These consequences are too dire."},{"t":"line","name":"Amiya","text":"Furthermore, as Infected..."},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_136_hsguma","name2":"char_002_amiya_1","focus":1}},{"t":"line","name":"Hoshiguma","text":"Hah. Given your small stature, it's cute when you try to give serious speeches."},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_136_hsguma","name2":"char_002_amiya_1","focus":2}},{"t":"line","name":"Amiya","text":"..."},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_136_hsguma","name2":"char_002_amiya_1#6","focus":2}},{"t":"line","name":"Amiya","text":"Eh? Huh?!"},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_136_hsguma","name2":"char_002_amiya_1#6","focus":1}},{"t":"line","name":"Hoshiguma","text":"Hahaha, I was just giving you a hard time."},{"t":"line","name":"Hoshiguma","text":"But you don't have to persuade me. I understand your concern."},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_136_hsguma"}},{"t":"line","name":"Hoshiguma","text":"L.G.D.! We will be Rhodes Island's shield!"},{"t":"line","name":"Hoshiguma","text":"Block the entrance, and don't let a single Reunion member enter or exit!"},{"t":"line","name":"Hoshiguma","text":"We'll let the experts handle this problem!"},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_002_amiya_1"}},{"t":"line","name":"Amiya","text":"Inspector..."},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_136_hsguma","name2":"char_002_amiya_1","focus":1}},{"t":"line","name":"Hoshiguma","text":"Oh, just call me Hoshiguma."},{"t":"line","name":"Hoshiguma","text":"Go. Please take care of Ch'en."},{"t":"line","name":"Hoshiguma","text":"Make sure you bring her back with you in one piece."},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_136_hsguma","name2":"char_002_amiya_1#7","focus":2}},{"t":"line","name":"Amiya","text":"I will, Hoshiguma...! I swear I'll bring Madam Ch'en back safely...!"},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_136_hsguma","name2":"char_002_amiya_1#7","focus":1}},{"t":"line","name":"Hoshiguma","text":"Make sure to stay safe yourselves."},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_136_hsguma","name2":"char_002_amiya_1#7","focus":2}},{"t":"line","name":"Amiya","text":"Okay!"},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_002_amiya_1#7"}},{"t":"line","name":"Amiya","text":"Doctor, please follow me."},{"t":"line","name":"Amiya","text":"Rhodes Island, let's go!"},{"t":"cmd","c":"dialog","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"blocker","a":{"a":1,"r":0,"g":0,"b":0,"fadetime":0.6,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"fadetime":0}},{"t":"cmd","c":"background","a":{"fadetime":0}},{"t":"cmd","c":"blocker","a":{"a":0,"fadetime":0.6,"block":true}},{"t":"line","name":"Amiya","text":"(Wait for me, Madam Ch'en...)"},{"t":"line","name":"Amiya","text":"(Frostleaf, Meteorite, Jessica...)"},{"t":"line","name":"Amiya","text":"(You have to stay strong!)"},{"t":"cmd","c":"dialog","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"blocker","a":{"a":1,"r":0,"g":0,"b":0,"fadetime":1,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"background","a":{"screenadapt":"coverall","image":"bg_cher_3","width":1,"height":1,"fadetime":0}},{"t":"cmd","c":"blocker","a":{"a":0,"fadetime":1,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_016_medic","name2":"char_003_kalts_1","focus":1}},{"t":"line","name":"Medic","text":"We've retrieved the recon team that we were last in contact with."},{"t":"line","name":"Medic","text":"It's... looking really bad..."},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_016_medic","name2":"char_003_kalts_1","focus":2}},{"t":"line","name":"Kal'tsit","text":"..."},{"t":"line","name":"Kal'tsit","text":"Rubor, hypothermia, and necrosis..."},{"t":"line","name":"Kal'tsit","text":"What's going on here?"},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"fadetime":0}},{"t":"line","name":"Wounded Operator","text":"Ngh..."},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_003_kalts_1#3"}},{"t":"line","name":"Kal'tsit","text":"Completely frostbitten...?"},{"t":"cmd","c":"delay","a":{"time":0.6}},{"t":"cmd","c":"dialog","a":{}},{"t":"cmd",